{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_02_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_02","title":"墨魎","storyCode":"WR-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"5e0256b1293b1eef9cbc0d47356622b10da7aa569641c94b21782b9ce721cdb1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"——點睛之筆，最是難得。徐夫人苦思冥想，始終缺那最後一筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"徐夫人不敢妄動，卻又始終找不到最心儀的念想，心煩意亂，只好上街散心。正巧聽見一位屠戶吆喝，身旁籠子裡，關著一隻肥美羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"徐夫人盯著那隻羽獸看了許久。興許是意識到了死期將至，這頭畜生木然地注視著往來的行人，反而不怎麼鬧騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"看著看著，徐夫人不由開始想像起來，若自己是那隻羽獸，心裡，會想著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"來往的都是無法理解的異類，遠離青草與河畔，在這處不屬於自己的文明的荒野，孑然一身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"命運早已不再是可以被談論的範疇，只能謀求一場盛大的解脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"單單用無助和麻木是無法形容那種感覺的——徐夫人不由得靠近了幾步，羽獸似乎是被這種異想天開的眼神所吸引，也朝徐夫人看了去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"就這一刹那，根本不需要什麼強烈的技法、稀少的色彩，也根本不需要擔憂那位買畫貴人的心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"成與敗，得與失，徐夫人在這隻待宰的羽獸眼裡，都找到了答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"她掏錢買下了那隻羽獸，在自家院子的小池裡養了起來，便立刻提筆點睛，水到渠成，再無半點阻塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"第二天，徐夫人順利完成了那幅仕女圖，得到達官貴人們的盛讚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著滿貫金銀回家的路上，徐夫人卻始終覺得點睛之筆外，還缺了點什麼，悵然若失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"直到她推開家門，看見那隻在池子裡撲水的羽獸，才恍然驚覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"她本以為自己功成名就，跳出案板久矣，殊不知只是換了處水塘，再無自由罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的徐夫人早已不是那意氣風發的年輕女子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"提筆數十載，名利雙收，但丈夫英年早逝，如今又要處處看他人臉色，又有誰來為她點睛，把她放回她的田野上呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"當晚回到徐府的，只有一車車金銀財寶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"據說之後有人在姜齊地界見過徐夫人，但無論如何，自此之後，這位被譽為“風華所在”的女畫家，就再也沒有出現過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"直到二十年後，夕城權貴間流傳起了一幅據說是徐夫人絕筆的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"世人多以為假，與徐夫人早年作品格格不入，不明所以。畫多留白，畫中只有一隻羽獸，形貌若死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"許多品鑑者以為，同樣畫獸，當時有不少大家畫的飛禽走獸，栩栩如生，靈動非凡，仿佛隨時能走出畫卷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"而這隻羽獸，生硬異常，毫無生機，故而被認作假畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"徐夫人的仰慕者中，有一位名叫歸余的人，歸余年輕時經商有道，如今又家道中落，散盡家財，前途未卜，最是失意時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"歸余看見這幅畫，看見那羽獸的眼，如遭雷擊。夢遊似地回到家中，久久不能釋然，寢食難安十數日後，下定決心，重整旗鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......世事無常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"興許只有同為失意人的歸余，才能看清徐夫人埋藏在那隻面若死灰的羽獸雙眼裡，生生不息的渴望，以及那“獸囚於畫中”的意味吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"生活，生活莫過於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生果然搜集了許多奇聞軼事，讓人大開眼界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，好像大都是關於炎國畫家的傳說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，我的書房裡藏書頗豐，也不乏各路野史筆札、志怪小說，但其中大部分確實都與歷史上那些赫赫有名的大畫家有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了，也有記載一些因為各種原因籍籍無名，被埋沒在大炎宏史中的小角色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然最終未能嶄露頭角，卻也有對這片大地的驚鴻一瞥，不知被誰記錄下來，也不知真假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來......炎熔小姐替朋友尋找的那位，也是個畫家，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若是師出名門，或是在某地小有名氣，說不定能找到些線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"施主你看，這裡就是小鎮的出口啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！這樣的天色，不提燈籠真的是什麼都看不見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"敢問大師，你去過鎮外嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？你們不是從外面來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，我......我當時大醉一場，一覺醒來，就已經跟著夥伴們躺在客棧裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣啊。鎮西邊呢，有座鴻洞山，從這裡出去，走個幾里山路，就到啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"不過鴻洞山常年有奇異鬼物出沒，小僧還是不建議你擅自靠近呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......鬼、鬼物，就是那些怪物吧，大師可知道那些東西的真面貌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"能猜到點線索罷了，不敢妄言。小僧一般把那些東西叫做“墨魎”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"墨？啊，是因為它們都會變成一灘污水消失嗎？果然貼切，真不愧是大師啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"過獎過獎，只是小僧兒時，常聽住持爺爺說起“魍魎”的鬼故事，記憶深刻罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"謙虛謙虛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"本地人將墨魎來襲的日子稱為“除夕”，得徹夜不眠，躲去求太陽庇護。這倒是和小僧聽聞的大炎“除夕夜”有不少差距......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"莫非，這是因為大炎地大物博，各地方風俗各異？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有沒有，我那裡也沒聽說過有這樣的除夕，那些墨魎我更是前所未見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧雲遊四方，見到墨魎的次數也寥寥無幾。來到婆山鎮後也是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！那我們還真是倒了大霉......剛來到這個地方，就遇上了墨魎襲擊城鎮......幸好沒持續多久，不然我可就要交待在這兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧還以為施主掐指一算便事事皆知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，我要是有那個能耐，也不至於——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——慢著，你說的那些墨魎，平時可會離開鴻洞山？是否會有落單的墨魎偶然靠近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧閒來無事便會在鎮上遛達，從未見過墨魎靠近，除了上次，那可真是成群結隊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是意味著，如果看見一隻，就意味著有一群？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"小僧以為，多半如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那咱們最好趕緊跑路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？施主什麼意思——啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，又怎麼了呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸說過，你是幫助了村子的英雄，那你一定很厲害吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯~英雄就是厲害的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"英雄只是願意幫助其他人而已哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣呀......啊，姐姐你看，這裡就是我說的酒樓啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"叫醉......醉晴樓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......很漂亮的炎國字，你認得出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"認得出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我們進去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這裡的客房比我家裡還寬敞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"確實還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐你是打算住在這裡嗎？好棒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"(擺件......桌椅制式......還有文字的樣式，都是線索，全部記一下吧......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......等一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！我剛才是不是聽見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"——鐘聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"大、大師啊，動作能不能快點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"急不來急不來，小僧得敲滿十二下才可以呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——噫——剛才是不是有什麼東西從房檐上飛過去了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"還差，最後三下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我來幫忙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......一天之內竟然來了兩次，竟如此頻繁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"“一天之內”......就是說二十四小時之內吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"白天黑夜不會交替還真是麻煩，萬一睡了個懶覺，豈不是再也記不住時間了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，偷懶可不是什麼好習慣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，炎熔小姐可真是從容不迫，想必先前突然面對那些怪物，也未曾生怯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......突發情況總是很多的，您看上去也非常平靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你看咱們頭頂烈陽，那些妖物啊，到不了我這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有人受傷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若撤離慢了，怕是在所難免......只要不因此喪命，就已經是萬幸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......煮傘先生，我有個提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會幫助婆山鎮安然度過除夕，那些怪物並不強，我們會盡全力保證村民們的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我想等到婆山鎮安全之後，煮傘先生能幫我們離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡？這當然是小事一樁，可......小姐初來乍到，真願意為我們以身犯險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，那些怪物只是可怕，其實不怎麼厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"——那我先替婆山鎮的所有人，對小姐道一聲謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩、恩人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，施主就是烏有口中的恩人炎熔吧！幸會幸會，小僧名喚嵯峨，來自東——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"誒誒誒，大師大師，自報家門就先等等吧，那些墨魎都衝進鎮子裡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......魔......兩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"是小僧給那些鬼物取的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"墨魎......墨魎，取自魑魅魍魎，如此甚好，總算有個統一的稱呼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那些墨......墨魎不算什麼威脅，不用那麼緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！頗有氣勢！甚好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人呐，我感覺這次好像不太一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼不一樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"它們，就是，呃，有點......多？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["嵯峨","烏有"]}]}
